fined engineering, and modern minimalism.</div><div>The Futura Wall Hung Bidette is designed as a companion to the <a href=\"#/product/sku-fut003\">Futura Wall Hung Pan</a>,  ensuring consistency in proportion, projection and alignment across the suite.</div><div>Wall hung installation enhances visual lightness and simplifies floor cleaning within the bathroom environment.</div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
